# AgentGate does not use this YAML file.
#
# Admin credentials (hardcoded admin role): copy admin.json.example to
# admin.json next to the project root and edit it, OR set the env vars
# AGENTGATE_ADMIN_USER / AGENTGATE_ADMIN_PASS. If neither is provided, a random
# one-time admin password is generated and stored in data/secret.json (and
# printed to the console on first run).
#
# Runtime secrets (JWT signing key, fallback admin token) are auto-generated in
# data/secret.json. Other knobs live in app/config.py.
